# RFID command service for specific commands
# This service requires a response before it can perform another action

# This is a string command of either
# "read", "write"
string command
# this is a string containing optional data to write to the RFID tag
string data
---

# This is a string response either containing some error message, a success explanation
# or the data read from the RFID tag (in the case of read commands)
string response
